        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>1 机械运动</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #000;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 555px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 40px 30px 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  /* Header logo area */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: center;\n    height: 46px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .logo-placeholder {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 40px;\n  }\n  .rule {\n    border: 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #000;\n    margin: 6px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  h1.doc-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 26px 0 30px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .kaodian-line {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin: 22px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .kaodian-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .kaodian-meta {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .kaodian-meta u {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .kaodian-meta .gap {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 18px;\n  }\n  table.grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  table.grid td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  td.col1 {\n    width: 78px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  td.col2 {\n    width: 150px;\n  }\n  td.col3 {\n    width: auto;\n  }\n  .center-b {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .pagenum {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 40px;\n    bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder logo-placeholder\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Logo: 洋葱学院 — 好课上洋葱·学习更主动, top-right]</figure>\n  </div>\n  <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"doc-title\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;机械运动</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"kaodian-line\">\n    <div class=\"kaodian-title\">【考点 1】长度、时间及其测量</div>\n    <div class=\"kaodian-meta\"><u>难度 ★</u><span class=\"gap\"></span><u>考频 ☆☆☆</u></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"grid\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col1\">单位换算<br>和估测</td>\n      <td class=\"col2\">1km=10<sup>3</sup>m；&nbsp;&nbsp;1dm=10<sup>-1</sup>m；<br>\n        1cm=10<sup>-2</sup>m；&nbsp;&nbsp;1mm=10<sup>-3</sup>m；<br>\n        1μm=10<sup>-6</sup>m；1nm=10<sup>-9</sup>m</td>\n      <td class=\"col3\">一支新的 2B 铅笔的长度约为 18cm；<br>\n        随着音乐做一套眼保健操时约为 4min；<br>\n        物理教材的长度是 252mm；<br>\n        他自己的身高是 16.7dm；<br>\n        人的心脏正常跳动一次的时间约为 0.8s。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col1\">刻度尺的<br>读数</td>\n      <td class=\"col2\">测量结果由数字和单位组成，其中数字部分由准确值加上一位估计值组成</td>\n      <td class=\"col3\">若刻度尺的分度值是 1mm，那读数应为 4.30cm 或 4.31cm，最后一位\"0\"、\"1\"是估读值</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col1\" rowspan=\"4\">长度测量<br>的特殊方<br>法</td>\n      <td class=\"col2\">累积法</td>\n      <td class=\"col3\">测一张邮票的厚度时，可先测 50 张的厚度</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col2\">化曲为直法</td>\n      <td class=\"col3\">用棉线测弯曲工件的长度。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col2\">平移法（配合法）</td>\n      <td class=\"col3\">用游标卡尺测量螺母直径；<br>测身高用的卡尺。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col2\">比例法</td>\n      <td class=\"col3\">利用竹竿和影子长度测量建筑物高度。</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"kaodian-line\" style=\"margin-top:34px;\">\n    <div class=\"kaodian-title\">【考点 2】机械运动</div>\n    <div class=\"kaodian-meta\"><u>难度 ★★</u><span class=\"gap\"></span><u>考频 ☆☆☆</u></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"grid\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col1\">参照物</td>\n      <td class=\"col2\">要描述一个物体是运动的还是静止的，要先选定一个标准物体作参照，这个选定的标准物体叫参照物</td>\n      <td class=\"col3\">\"两岸青山相对出\"选取都为参照物；<br>\n        人站在下面水流很快的桥上头晕，是因为人选河水为参照物；<br>\n        月亮在云层中穿行选云层为参照物；<br>\n        通常我们说\"风力 4 级\"是以地面为参照物。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col1\">运动和静止<br>的相对性</td>\n      <td class=\"col2\">物体是静止的还是运动的，与所选的<b>参照物</b>有关</td>\n      <td class=\"col3\">地球同步卫星地面为参照物时是静止的，选太阳为参照物时是运动的；<br>\n        起飞的飞机中的乘客相对大地是运动的，相对飞机是静止的。</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"pagenum\">1</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
